uct and i had a hard  time  getting the value out of that and  putting my name behind it  you know i could maybe make a lot of  money i could pitch somebody's prop and  say hey this is the greatest thing ever  you know mary i think you should buy  this product because it's fantastic  but if i haven't used it and i haven't  found benefit in it then  i don't want you buying some info  product and maybe i make a good  commission off of it but then  you find out that it's a junky product  and say oh that happens a douchebag for  recommending it and then you're never  going to come back and visit my website  and that's not the relationship that i  want to build so  i want to try to promote things that i  actually use  and enjoy and find value in so i  didn't have a lot of success with the  affiliate marketing model  um i did create my own business planning  product  so i had a hard time finding a good  business plan product so i started my  own  so it is one product that we do sell but  mostly my revenue comes from advertising  and sponsorship  and it all started from me not not  trying to  go out and make a lot of money doing  advertising and sponsorship but  trying to help entrepreneurs and answer  their questions and help them grow their  business and  follow my passions that's what i really  enjoy so i hope that helps answer the  question  if you enjoyed the video please give it  a thumbs up and i'd also love to hear  your thoughts and feedback  if you want to leave a comment below the  video and stay tuned for the next  episode  you
 

